ParallelBandData[h, samples, n] retains the n eigenvalues selected by \
Eigenvalues at each sample. ParallelBandData[{h, s}, samples] solves the \
generalized eigenvalue problem for the Hamiltonian h and overlap matrix s. \
ParallelBandData[{h, s}, samples, n] retains n eigenvalues from each \
